<title>MOZAMBIQUE: SOCCER-MOZAMBIQUE BEAT TANZANIA IN COSAFA CUP MATCH.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MOZAMBIQUE BEAT TANZANIA IN COSAFA CUP MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>MAPUTO 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mozambique beat Tanzania 3-0</p>
<p>(halftime 0-0) in their Cosafa Castle Cup final round group</p>
<p>match on Sunday:</p>
<p>Scorers: Tico-Tico 50, 69, Adelino 73</p>
<p>Attendance: 50,000</p>
<p>    Standings    P   W   D   L   F   A   Pts</p>
<p> Mozambique	2   1   1   0   5   2    4</p>
<p> Zambia	    1   1   0   0   4   0    3</p>
<p> Namibia	   1   0   1   0   0   0    1</p>
<p> Malawi	    2   0   1   1   2   6    1</p>
<p> Tanzania	  2   0   1   1   0   3    1</p>
<p>Next match: June 28 - Namibia v Malawi, in Windhoek</p>
</text>
